      },
      "message": "feat(ui): tool Properties summary, holder pick and Body section in the tool library window\n\nA saved tool's Properties page is a read-only summary with the door\n\"Edit in tool library\". The holder picker leaves the tool shape window.\nThe tool library window's Tool tab gets a folded Body section (the\nstand-in holder cylinder and the body import, placement and pieces) from\nits own body draft. The Recipes tab takes the rest of the old Cutting\ndata group. The tests that drove the Properties fields and the shape\nwindow's picker move to the window.\n\nFixes #3930\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
